=4 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{1}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{8}} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{6}.\n$$"] [:db/add "aab11cbb-85e5-57da-b4a7-b4addcfd3ea8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "aab11cbb-85e5-57da-b4a7-b4addcfd3ea8" :question/answer-fields "673634e4-5e04-5eda-a7a6-f7a174911552"] [:db/ensure "aab11cbb-85e5-57da-b4a7-b4addcfd3ea8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "aab11cbb-85e5-57da-b4a7-b4addcfd3ea8"] [:db/add "612b128d-6800-5667-9a70-a616ca64e238" :answer/id #uuid "612b128d-6800-5667-9a70-a616ca64e238"] [:db/add "612b128d-6800-5667-9a70-a616ca64e238" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "612b128d-6800-5667-9a70-a616ca64e238" :answer/value "-1 + \\frac{\\pi}{8}"] [:db/ensure "612b128d-6800-5667-9a70-a616ca64e238" :answer/validate] [:db/add "04d7f557-20f2-5761-a1ee-457cc269186f" :answer/id #uuid "04d7f557-20f2-5761-a1ee-457cc269186f"] [:db/add "04d7f557-20f2-5761-a1ee-457cc269186f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "04d7f557-20f2-5761-a1ee-457cc269186f" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{8}"] [:db/ensure "04d7f55